OL,3,GNEWSAAirbourne set to return to
OL,4,AEastbourne for 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK's largest free air show will
OL,7,Freturn to East Sussex next year,
OL,8,Forganisers have announced.
OL,10,FEastbourne International Airshow, also
OL,11,Fknown as Airbourne, is set to run from
OL,12,F12 ` 15 August in 2027, its 33rd year.
OL,14,FThis year's event hosted military
OL,15,Fdisplays, historic warbirds and
OL,16,Faerobatic flying teams who performed in
OL,17,Fthe sky along a two-mile stretch on the
OL,18,Ftown's coast.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
